OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for tower near historical
OL,4,Apub rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a 17-storey tower block next
OL,7,Fto a historical Manchester pub have
OL,8,Fbeen rejected by councillors.
OL,10,FDeveloper The McGoff Group had applied
OL,11,Fto build 153 flats beside the Grade
OL,12,FII-listed Marble Arch on Rochdale Road,
OL,13,Fwhich has been serving customers since
OL,14,F1888.
OL,16,FThe company said the scheme would
OL,17,Fdeliver much-needed city centre housing
OL,18,Fand help regenerate the area.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
