OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for tower near historical
OL,4,Apub rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the pub's owners argued the
OL,7,Fdevelopment threatened its future, and
OL,8,FManchester City Council's planning
OL,9,Fcommittee voted to refuse the
OL,10,Fapplication.
